<!-- FOUNDER -->
<div class="page" id="page-founder">
  <div class="founder-hero">
    <div style="position:relative;width:90px;margin:0 auto 14px;">
      <div class="founder-photo">&#128104;&#8205;&#128187;<div class="founder-online"></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="founder-name">Tarun Singh</div>
    <div class="founder-role">Founder &amp; Developer</div>
    <div class="founder-badges">
      <span class="fb">&#127981; Bharatpur, RJ</span>
      <span class="fb">&#9889; Full Stack Dev</span>
      <span class="fb">&#128640; Since 2024</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="section">
    <div class="quote-box">
      <div class="quote-text">"Why not build something of my own?"</div>
      <div class="quote-sub">- The thought that started everything</div>
    </div>
    <div class="sec-tag">Story</div>
    <div class="sec-h">The Journey <span>Behind TK</span></div>
    <div style="font-size:.83rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.56);line-height:1.8;margin:13px 0;">
      <p style="margin-bottom:11px;">Har business ek chhoti si soch se start hota hai... aur meri journey bhi isi simple thought se shuru hui. <strong style="color:#fff;">Coding samajhna easy nahi tha</strong>, errors baar baar aate the, aur kai baar laga ki shayad ye mere bas ki baat nahi hai...</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:11px;">Par phir ek cheez samajh aayi - <strong style="color:var(--accent);">agar ruk gaya to kuch nahi hoga.</strong> Late nights, YouTube se seekhna, aur khud se experiments karne se slowly confidence build hone laga.</p>
      <p>Maine notice kiya ki bahut se local businesses achha kaam kar rahe hain, par <strong style="color:#fff;">online presence na hone ki wajah se unki growth ruki hui hai.</strong> Isi gap ko bharne ke liye TK Web Solutions ka idea aaya.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(26,86,255,.1),rgba(0,229,255,.05));border:1px solid rgba(26,86,255,.2);border-radius:11px;padding:13px;text-align:center;margin:16px 0;">
      <div style="font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:.92rem;font-style:italic;">From Dreams... To Digital Reality. &#128640;</div>
    </div>
    <div class="sec-tag">Timeline</div>
    <div class="sec-h" style="margin-bottom:15px;">My <span>Journey</span></div>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="tl-item"><div class="tl-dot"></div><div class="tl-year">2023</div><div class="tl-title">&#127807; Coding Start Kiya</div><div class="tl-body">YouTube se HTML, CSS, JS seekha. Pehla website banaya - bahut saari galtiyan, bahut saara seekhna.</div></div>
      <div class="tl-item"><div class="tl-dot" style="background:var(--accent);"></div><div class="tl-year">2024 - Early</div><div class="tl-title">&#127970; TK Web Solutions Launch</div><div class="tl-body">Pehla client mila. Achievers Point Coaching ka website banaya. Positive feedback ne confidence diya!</div></div>
      <div class="tl-item"><div class="tl-dot" style="background:var(--gold);"></div><div class="tl-year">2024 - Mid</div><div class="tl-title">&#128200; Growth &amp; More Clients</div><div class="tl-body">5+ clients, e-commerce websites, NGO sites, school projects. Google mein ranking shuru!</div></div>
      <div class="tl-item"><div class="tl-dot" style="background:#4CAF50;"></div><div class="tl-year">2025</div><div class="tl-title">&#128241; App Development Added</div><div class="tl-body">Android app development service start ki. AI chatbot, payment systems, premium designs.</div></div>
